          %title References
          %h2#References References
          %h3#ReferencesHistoricalOrigins Historical origins
          %p
            The general idea of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topology"} topology
            goes back to:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Henri+Poincar%C3%A9"}> Henri Poincaré
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Analysis+Situs"} Analysis Situs
              %strong 2
              1 (1895) 1–123 [
              %a{:href => "https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k4337198/f7"}> gallica:12148/bpt6k4337198/f7
              , Engl:
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://www.maths.ed.ac.uk/~v1ranick/papers/poincare2009.pdf"} pdf
              = succeed "]" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Stillwell_AnalysisSitus.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            The notion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+space"} topological space
            involving
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/neighbourhoods"} neighbourhoods
            was first developed, for the special case now known as
            = succeed "," do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hausdorff+spaces"} Hausdorff spaces
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Felix+Hausdorff"}> Felix Hausdorff
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Grundz%C3%BCge+der+Mengenlehre"} Grundzüge der Mengenlehre
              = succeed "]" do
                %a{:href => "https://archive.org/details/grundzgedermen00hausuoft/page/n5/mode/2up"} ark:/13960/t2891gn8g
          %p
            The more general definition – dropping Hausdorff’s
            = succeed "-" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi T
                      %mn 2
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} T_2
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/separation+axiom"} separation axiom
            and formulated in terms of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/closure+operators"} closure operators
            that preserve finite
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/unions"} unions
            – is due to:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kazimierz+Kuratowski"}> Kazimierz Kuratowski
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Sur l’opération Ā de l’Analysis Situs
              %strong 3
              (1922) 182–199 [
              %a{:href => "https://www.impan.pl/pl/wydawnictwa/czasopisma-i-serie-wydawnicze/fundamenta-mathematicae/all/3/0/92454/sur-l-operation-a-de-l-analysis-situs"}> doi:10.4064/fm-3-1-182-199
              ]
          %p
            The modern formulation via
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/open+set"} open set
            was widely popularized by:
          %ul
            %li#Bourbak71
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nicolas+Bourbaki"}> Nicolas Bourbaki
                ],
                %em Eléments de mathématique II. Première partie. Les structures fondamentales de l’analyse. Livre III. Topologie générale. Chapitre I. Structures topologiques.
                Actualités scientifiques et industrielles, vol. 858. Hermann, Paris (1940)
              %p
                %em> General topology
                , Elements of Mathematics III, Springer (1971, 1990, 1995) [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-61701-0"}> doi:10.1007/978-3-642-61701-0
                ]
          %h3#further Further
          %p Further textbook accounts:
          %ul
            %li#Kelley55
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Kelley"}> John Kelley
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em General topology
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.springer.com/gp/book/9780387901251"} ISBN:978-0-387-90125-1
            %li#Dugundji66
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/James+Dugundji"}> James Dugundji
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topology
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.southalabama.edu/mathstat/personal_pages/carter/Dugundji.pdf"} pdf
            %li#Munkres75
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/James+Munkres"}> James Munkres
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topology
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "http://mathcenter.spb.ru/nikaan/2019/topology/4.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Richard+E.+Hodel"} Richard E. Hodel
                (ed.),
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Set-Theoretic Topology
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/C2013-0-11355-4"} doi:10.1016/C2013-0-11355-4
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mark+A.+Armstrong"}> Mark A. Armstrong
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Basic Topology
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-1-4757-1793-8"} doi:10.1007/978-1-4757-1793-8
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://math.mit.edu/~hrm/palestine/armstrong-basic-topology.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Klaus+J%C3%A4nich"}> Klaus Jänich
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topology
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/book/9780387908922"} ISBN:9780387908922
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-662-10574-0"} doi:10.1007/978-3-662-10574-0
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "http://topologicalmedialab.net/xinwei/classes/readings/Janich/Janich_Topology_ch1-2.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mark+A.+Armstrong"}> Mark A. Armstrong
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Basic Topology
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-1-4757-1793-8"} doi:10.1007/978-1-4757-1793-8
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://math.mit.edu/~hrm/palestine/armstrong-basic-topology.pdf"} pdf
            %li#Engelking89
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ryszard+Engelking"}> Ryszard Engelking
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em General Topology
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 6
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.heldermann.de/SSPM/SSPM06/sspm06.htm"} ISBN:388538-006-4
            %li#Vickers89
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Steven+Vickers"}> Steven Vickers
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topology via Logic
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.gbv.de/dms/ilmenau/toc/21309293X.PDF"} toc pdf
            %li#Bredon93
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Glen+Bredon"}> Glen Bredon
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topology and Geometry
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 139
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-1-4757-6848-0"} doi:10.1007/978-1-4757-6848-0
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "http://virtualmath1.stanford.edu/~ralph/math215b/Bredon.pdf"} pdf
            %li#Lawson03
              %p
                Terry Lawson:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topology: A Geometric Approach
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://global.oup.com/academic/product/topology-a-geometric-approach-9780198515975"} ISBN:9780198515975
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "http://users.metu.edu.tr/serge/courses/422-2014/supplementary/TGeometric.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                Anatole Katok, Alexey Sossinsky,
                %em Introduction to Modern Topology and Geometry
                (2010) [
                %a{:href => "http://akatok.s3-website-us-east-1.amazonaws.com/TOPOLOGY/Contents.pdf"}> toc pdf
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/KatokSossinsky-Topology-Ch1.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            and leading over to
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+theory"} homotopy theory
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ioan+Mackenzie+James"}> Ioan Mackenzie James
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em General Topology and Homotopy Theory
              %p
                (
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-1-4613-8283-6"}> doi:10.1007/978-1-4613-8283-6
                )
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/counterexamples"} counterexamples
            in topology:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lynn+Arthur+Steen"}> Lynn Arthur Steen
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/J.+Arthur+Seebach"} J. Arthur Seebach
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Counterexamples+in+Topology"} Counterexamples in Topology
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-1-4612-6290-9"} doi:10.1007/978-1-4612-6290-9
          %p
            With emphasis on
